    "property_title": "Verona Walk-up Apartment in Cagayan de Oro City",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Verona Green Apartments is IDC’s first economic housing project in Cagayan de Oro City. This is a mixed-use, four-storey, low-rise, walk-up apartment located in Uptown CDO, just across SM City Mall and Pueblo Business Park. It is also right beside upcoming Manresa Township which is going to be one of the biggest projects to be launched in the Uptown area. This would be an ideal investment for those who have kids going to school in Xavier University and at a more affordable price point.\r\n\r\nThe project is composed of 2 phases.  Phase 1 is targeted to be turned over in 2024. While phase 2 target turn over is 2026. As you can see, Italpinas opted for a more lively look with their buildings sporting a variety of colors – orange, yellow, green and maroon. The buildings will also be utilizing innovative green technology similar to their previous projects.\r\n\r\nTotal Package Price:      2.3M\r\nReservation fee:            10,000 \r\nRequired income:          40,000 – 50,000\r\n\r\nEquity is at 10% - 5% payable in 14 months and the other 5% payable in balloon payment\r\n5% Equity:                    7,385.71 for 14 months\r\n5% Balloon Payment:    113,400.00\r\n90% Bank Financing:      15,903.00/mo for 20 years 7%\r\n90% HDMF Financing:    12,797.00/mo for 30 years for 6.375%\r\n\r\n*Disclaimer: Prices may change without prior notice. Contact me for an updated inventory and computation",
